    "Equal complete profiles retain continuation while the current executable route changes; stale route witness is rejected.",
    "An independently constructed six-stage finite reference replaces declarative comparator ties.",
    "Accessors are refused by the strict charter boundary before invocation.",
    "Joint realization now compiles and checks every admitted updater; empty operation sets receive an explicit identity service. No-op and multioperation controls are covered by the baseline tests."
  ],
